<title>UK: BBV Latinvest appoints Peter West chief economist.</title>
<headline>BBV Latinvest appoints Peter West chief economist.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BBV Latinvest said on Monday it had appointed Peter West as chief economist based in London.</p>
<p>West, economic adviser at West Merchant Bank, will join the group on July 1.</p>
<p>It said the appointment was part of an expansion programme that started following the acquisition of Latinvest by Banco Bilbao Vizcaya at the end of last year.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
</text>
